<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner wins 30 mln stg prison contract.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins 30 mln stg prison contract.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian engineering and shipbuilding group Kvaerner ASA said on Friday it had won a contract worth 30 million stg to build a prison in Nottinghamshire, Britain.</p>
</text>
